  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Temporary files and folders in fcrepo-server/src/test/java/fedora/utilities/TestZip.java package fedora.utilities have hard coded names and are not deleted upon exit. ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "I suggest a complete rewrite using File.createTempFile with System.nanoTime(). As is now the this class is not particularly easy to maintain or patch.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "For now I've patched it as follows:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "<snippet>",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "private final String TMP_DIR = System.getProperty(\"java.io.tmpdir\");",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "private final String ZIP_FILE = TMP_DIR + File.separator + \"test\" + System.nanoTime() + \".zip\";",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "private final String TEST_DIR = TMP_DIR + File.separator + \"test\" + System.nanoTime();",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "...",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "File foo = new File(testDir, \"foo\");",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "File bar = new File(testDir, \"bar\");",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "File baz = new File(bar, \"baz\");",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "</snippet>",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "and that's not very pretty! Something like this might be better:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "<snippet>",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "//private final String TMP_DIR = System.getProperty(\"java.io.tmpdir\");",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "private final String ZIP_FILE = File.separator + \"test.zip\";",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "private final String TEST_DIR = File.separator + \"test\";",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "...",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "File foo = File directory = File.createTempFile(\"foo\", System.nanoTime(), System.getProperty(\"java.io.tmpdir\") ); ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "File bar = File directory = File.createTempFile(\"bar\", System.nanoTime(), System.getProperty(\"java.io.tmpdir\") ); ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "File baz = File directory = File.createTempFile(\"baz\", System.nanoTime(), System.getProperty(\"java.io.tmpdir\") ); ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "</snippet>",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "though a more extensive rewrite would be preferable.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Please refer to ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://fedora-commons.org/jira/browse/FCREPO-723"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://fedora-commons.org/jira/browse/FCREPO-723",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": " for a similiar issue.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
