      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>Oops, missed that \"test\" is used in two places! (Bad smell? <img class=\"emoticon\" src=\"/images/icons/emoticons/smile.png\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\" border=\"0\"/>). Anyhow, here's a quick fix:</p>\n\n<p>    private final String ZIP_FILE = TMP_DIR + File.separator + \"test\" + System.nanoTime() + \".zip\";<br/>\n    private final String TEST_STR = \"test\" + System.nanoTime();<br/>\n    private final String TEST_DIR = TMP_DIR + File.separator + TEST_STR;</p>",
     "created": "23/Jun/10 1:24 PM",
